        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yieen da̱ŋ rɛw",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛmɛ ɛ min laar Kuoth Nhial ni Kuothdä jɛ lar i̱, “Yien det ti ba wä näk ti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ci ji̱kiɛn kɛ näk kä cikɛ wä a /ka̱nkɛ duäc. Kä cu nɛy tin kɔkɛ wee i̱, ‘Ɛ puɔ̱th tekɛ Kuoth Nhial, kɛ ɣöö cakɔ tekɛ ti ŋuan.’ Kä /ken yiëënkiɛn kɛ nhɔk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ruac ɛn ɣöö ɣän /cä bi tekɛ nhök kɛ ji̱ wec muɔ̱ɔ̱n. Kä ɣän bä nɛy diaal la̱th tetni kua̱rikiɛn. Kä bikɛ wi̱c muɔ̱ɔ̱n däk, kä thilɛ ram mi bä luäk tetnikiɛn.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cua̱ det tin ba wä näk ɛ nɛy tin ciaŋkɛ det a jiäk wä yien. Kä cua̱ rɔ moc kɛ kɛtni da̱ŋ rɛw. Cua kɛl cɔl i̱ gɔɔy kä cua min dɔ̱ŋ cɔli mat. Kä cua̱ det tit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ pay kɛl cua̱ da̱k kɛ yiëën da̱ŋ diɔ̱k. Ɣän cä ŋɔ̱a̱ŋ kɛ kɛ kä cikɛ ŋɔ̱a̱ŋ bäkɛ ɣä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua det jiök i̱, “/Ci ɣän bia̱ yieendun. Kä mɔ bi li̱wɔ a jɛ li̱w. Kä a tɔ̱ bi riaw tɔ̱, riaw. Kä a tɔ̱ bi duɔth tɔ̱ ramɔ cam ri̱ŋ kä mɔ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua̱ kɛɛtdä min cɔal i̱ gɔɔy ka̱n, kä cua̱ jɛ to̱l, da̱kä mat ruac mëë cä la̱t kɛ döör diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cua mat ruac däk ɛn cäŋ ëë. Kä cu nɛy tin ciaŋkɛ det a jiäk, tëë guɛckɛ ɣä jɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö ɛ ruac Kuɔth Nhial la̱tdä mɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua̱ kɛ jiök i̱, “Mi guic yɛnɛ, ɛ cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ kä ɣä, kä ka̱mɛ ɣä kökdä. Kä mi guic yɛnɛ /ciɛ cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ kä ɣä, akɛ tekɛ yɛ.” Kä cukɛ ɣä ka̱m yio̱w ti jiɛn diɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu Kuoth Nhial ɣä jiök i̱, “Läth nikɛ guäth tɔ̱ɔ̱wä yio̱o̱ni.” Kɛn yio̱w tëë ca ka̱m ɣä ɛ kɛn. Kä cua̱ kɛn yio̱w ti jiɛn diɔ̱k ka̱n, kä cua̱ kɛ la̱th guäth tɔ̱wä yio̱o̱ni rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua̱ kɛɛtdä min rɛwdɛ, min cɔali mat töl, da̱kä mat kam Juda kɛnɛ I-thɛ-rɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ɣä jiök i̱, “Nyɔk yien deet mi thil luɔt kɛ lätni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ɣän bä yieen deet nööŋ wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n, mi /ci bi diɛɛr kɛ det tin ci riaw, kä /cɛ tin ci bath bi go̱r, kä /cɛ tin tekɛ buɔ̱ɔ̱t bi jak kä gɔaa, kä /cɛ tin ci duɔth bi la̱a̱k, duundɛ ɣöö bɛ cam ni ri̱ŋ kä tin ci cuath, kä bɛ ka̱m ni barkaknikiɛn raar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
